      "description": "Development-only visual preview of the imported shared Button/buttonVariants treatment; application code must use the official source.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-outline\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7M5 12h14\"/></svg>Edit your farm</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-outline{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:inline-flex;max-width:100%;min-height:48px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;text-align:center;white-space:normal;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;background:var(--card);color:var(--foreground);border-color:var(--input);}.ds-button-outline:hover{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-foreground);}.ds-button-outline:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-button-outline:active{filter:brightness(.98)}.ds-button-outline:disabled{pointer-events:none;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-outline{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-outline"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ghost action",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Development-only visual preview of the imported shared Button/buttonVariants treatment; application code must use the official source.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-ghost\">Expand map</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-ghost{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:inline-flex;max-width:100%;min-height:48px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;text-align:center;white-space:normal;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;background:transparent;color:var(--foreground);min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;}.ds-button-ghost:hover{background:var(--muted);color:var(--foreground);}.ds-button-ghost:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-button-ghost:active{filter:brightness(.98)}.ds-button-ghost:disabled{pointer-events:none;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-ghost{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-ghost"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navigation action",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Development-only visual preview of the imported shared Button/buttonVariants treatment; application code must use the official source.",
      "html": "<a href=\"#comparison\" class=\"ds-button-link\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7M5 12h14\"/></svg>Back to comparison</a>",
      "css": ".ds-button-link{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:inline-flex;max-width:100%;min-height:48px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;text-align:center;white-space:normal;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;background:transparent;color:var(--primary);text-underline-offset:4px;padding-inline:0;}.ds-button-link:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.ds-button-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-button-link:active{filter:brightness(.98)}.ds-button-link:disabled{pointer-events:none;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-link{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "button-link"
    },
    {
      "name": "Labeled input",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Development-only preview of imported Field, FieldLabel, and Input. Field labels use weight 500 and persistent association.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\"><label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-latitude\">Latitude (° N)</label><input class=\"ds-field-input\" id=\"ds-latitude\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"decimal\" step=\"any\" value=\"13.1775\" aria-describedby=\"ds-field-help\"/><p class=\"ds-field-help\" id=\"ds-field-help\">Enter a coordinate within the Albay pilot area.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;max-width:100%;color:var(--foreground)}.ds-field-label{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375}.ds-field-input{height:48px;width:100%;min-width:0;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--input);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--card);color:var(--foreground);font:inherit;font-size:16px;transition:border-color 150ms}.ds-field-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.ds-field-input:focus-visible{border-color:var(--ring);outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-field-input:disabled{pointer-events:none;opacity:.5;background:color-mix(in oklab,var(--input) 50%,transparent)}.ds-field-input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--destructive)}.ds-field-help{margin:0;color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-field-input{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "input"
    },
    {
      "name": "Location entry",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Development-only visual preview of the real location-results Combobox and explicit-search InputGroup composition. Both columns are equal from a 24rem container; previews do not implement asynchronous requests or replace Base UI behavior.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-location\"><div class=\"ds-location-grid\"><div class=\"ds-location-field\"><label class=\"ds-location-label\" for=\"ds-results\">Choose farm location</label><div class=\"ds-location-group\"><input id=\"ds-results\" class=\"ds-location-input\" role=\"combobox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" readonly placeholder=\"Choose a place\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-location-toggle\" aria-label=\"Show location results\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"ds-location-field\"><label class=\"ds-location-label\" for=\"ds-search\">Search in Albay</label><div class=\"ds-location-group\"><input id=\"ds-search\" class=\"ds-location-input\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search for a place\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-location-search\" aria-label=\"Search\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"/><path d=\"m21 21-4.35-4.35\"/></svg></button></div></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-location{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);container-type:inline-size;color:var(--foreground)}.ds-location-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:12px}.ds-location-field{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.ds-location-label{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.375}.ds-location-group{display:flex;align-items:center;min-width:0;height:48px;border:1px solid var(--input);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--card);padding-right:3px}.ds-location-group:has(.ds-location-input:focus-visible){border-color:var(--ring);outline:3px solid color-mix(in oklab,var(--ring) 50%,transparent)}.ds-location-input{flex:1;min-width:0;width:100%;height:100%;padding:8px 6px 8px 12px;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius);background:transparent;color:var(--foreground);font:inherit;font-size:16px;text-align:left;outline:none}.ds-location-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.ds-location-toggle,.ds-location-search{display:flex;width:44px;height:44px;flex-shrink:0;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--card);color:var(--muted-foreground);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-location-toggle:hover,.ds-location-toggle:active,.ds-location-toggle[aria-expanded=\"true\"]{background:var(--card)}.ds-location-search:hover{background:var(--muted);color:var(--foreground)}.ds-location-toggle:focus-visible,.ds-location-search:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-location-search:disabled{opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}@container(min-width:24rem){.ds-location-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-location-toggle,.ds-location-search{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Labeled choices",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Development-only preview of the imported Checkbox and RadioGroup states. The app retains their Base UI checked, labeling, keyboard, and disabled contracts.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-choices\"><label class=\"ds-choice\"><span class=\"ds-choice-control\"><input class=\"ds-choice-checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" checked/><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></span><span>Rice</span></label><label class=\"ds-choice\"><input class=\"ds-choice-radio\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-irrigation\" checked/><span>Adequate</span></label><label class=\"ds-choice\"><input class=\"ds-choice-radio\" type=\"radio\" name=\"ds-irrigation\"/><span>Limited</span></label></div>",
      "css": ".ds-choices{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;color:var(--foreground)}.ds-choice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer}.ds-choice-control{position:relative;display:flex;width:16px;height:16px}.ds-choice-checkbox,.ds-choice-radio{appearance:none;flex-shrink:0;width:16px;height:16px;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--input);background:var(--card);cursor:pointer}.ds-choice-checkbox{border-radius:4px}.ds-choice-radio{border-radius:50%}.ds-choice-checkbox:checked,.ds-choice-radio:checked{border-color:var(--primary)}.ds-choice-checkbox:checked{background:var(--card)}.ds-choice-control svg{position:absolute;inset:1px;color:var(--primary);pointer-events:none;display:none}.ds-choice-checkbox:checked+svg{display:block}.ds-choice-radio:checked{background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--primary) 0 4px,var(--card) 4px)}.ds-choice-checkbox:focus-visible,.ds-choice-radio:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-choice-checkbox:disabled,.ds-choice-radio:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared header navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Development-only preview of AppShell brand navigation and imported outline Badge; the app also supplies the keyboard skip link and main landmark.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-header\"><a href=\"#planner\" class=\"ds-brand\" aria-label=\"AgriMatch home\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5a2 2 0 0 0-1.437-1.437l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .962 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .962L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.962 0Z\"/></svg><span>Agri<span class=\"ds-brand-accent\">Match</span></span></a><span class=\"ds-pilot\">Albay pilot · Demo</span></header>",
      "css": ".ds-header{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:flex;min-height:64px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px 12px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--foreground)}.ds-brand{display:inline-flex;min-height:44px;max-width:100%;align-items:center;gap:12px;border-radius:var(--radius);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:var(--foreground);text-decoration:none}.ds-brand>svg{color:var(--brand-mark);flex-shrink:0}.ds-brand-accent{color:var(--primary)}.ds-brand:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-pilot{display:inline-flex;min-height:28px;max-width:100%;align-items:center;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:9999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;color:var(--foreground)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Semantic badges",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Development-only preview of imported crop, success, and outlined rotation Badge variants. Pink uses forest text for contrast; labels wrap and are not standalone actions.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-badge-set\"><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-crop\">Rice</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-success\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg>Farm location selected</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-blue\">Option 1</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-green\">Option 2</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-badge-pink\">Option 3</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-badge-set{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-badge{display:inline-flex;min-height:28px;max-width:100%;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;white-space:normal;text-align:center}.ds-badge-crop{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-foreground)}.ds-badge-success{background:var(--success-surface);color:var(--success)}.ds-badge-blue{background:var(--card);color:var(--chart-1);border-color:var(--chart-1)}.ds-badge-green{background:var(--card);color:var(--chart-2);border-color:var(--chart-2)}.ds-badge-pink{background:var(--card);color:var(--foreground);border-color:var(--chart-3)}",
      "refersTo": "badge"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bounded feature Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Development-only preview of the installed official Card. Available only for a genuinely bounded feature; planner, snapshots, rotation options, and detail use open sections and must not adopt this as layout decoration.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-header\"><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">Bounded feature</h2><p class=\"ds-card-description\">Use only when the feature needs its own surface.</p></div><div class=\"ds-card-content\">The working planner and comparison remain open sections.</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:var(--font-geist-sans, sans-serif);display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:16px 0;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:var(--card);color:var(--card-foreground);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}.ds-card-header{display:grid;gap:4px;padding:0 16px}.ds-card-title{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.375}.ds-card-description{margin:0;color:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:14px;line-height:20px}.ds-card-content{padding:0 16px}@media(min-width:640px){.ds-card{gap:24px;padding:24px 0}.ds-card-header,.ds-card-content{padding:0 24px}}",
      "refersTo": "card"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The farm planning workspace",
    "overview": "This document defines the required interface system for every route and shared component. MUST means required; SHOULD permits a documented, concrete reason to deviate. Read this file before implementing or reviewing interface changes.\n\nAgriMatch is calm, practical, and trustworthy: cream page backgrounds, white controls, forest-green actions, and restrained sage accents. Readable farm inputs, clear comparisons, and honest explanations provide the hierarchy. The agricultural palette and Geist fonts are durable brand commitments from `PRODUCT.md`.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Open working sections with aligned controls and restrained divisions.",
      "One shared product scale, light palette, and official component vocabulary.",
      "Visible farm state, explicit requests, and clearly labeled demo results.",
      "Responsive document flow with reachable actions and unobscured focus."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Official Imports Rule",
        "body": "All application controls and styled UI surfaces MUST use official shadcn/ui components imported from the project's shared UI directory. Domain components MUST compose those imports. A custom HTML/CSS recreation of an available shadcn component is noncompliant.",
        "section": "overview"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workspace Rule",
        "body": "Ordinary workspace, snapshot, rotation, and detail content stays open. A border or tonal Alert identifies a meaningful boundary; it does not justify another Card.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** import official shared shadcn components for all supplied UI roles and compose them into domain features.",
      "**Do** preserve the palette through semantic tokens, readable color pairs, and consistent variants.",
      "**Do** use semantic HTML for document structure and ordinary text, with the specialist exceptions kept narrow.",
      "**Do** make every state honest, labeled, keyboard-accessible, and recoverable where recovery is possible."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** hand-build a control, Card, Badge, menu, or overlay that already has an official shadcn implementation.",
      "**Don't** introduce another UI kit, direct primitive-library implementations, or a second component base.",
      "**Don't** add route-level color literals, inline CSS skins, `!important` patches, or broad selectors that restyle shared primitives.",
      "**Don't** hide meaningful content in CSS pseudo-elements or rely on emoji, arbitrary glyphs, color, or hover alone to explain an action.",
      "**Don't** treat registry updates, new routes, or documentation previews as exempt from import, state, accessibility, and rendered verification requirements."
    ]
  }
}


